{"v":4,"catch":"讓美式足球以其高影響力的圖形和遊戲玩法讓美國瘋狂！","desc":"“TECMO BOWL”是TECMO在1987年發布的美式足球比賽。\n作為WILDCATS或BULLDOGS的玩家進行體驗比賽。\n預測對手的動作並偷球！使用傳球和奔跑來突破他們的線並得分驚人的觸地得分！\n\n “Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如游戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-02-27","genres":["街機","運動","派對"],"players":"單機 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":4,"poff":4,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d274790b775e92b5d85decbfa5ce89cfb6a46d0bce4461a7d4b8339c65ea676c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a6e06e49cc1f3fc1787c3f1bd7e25ab51cba9680a207770d336b7f1c0fd431aa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3fc946f5ff4998eb9358cf80a262dd253a015ecb36a3f437f2109776d7405109.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7c2372ffedf0c0736cab96ebb8a913d1972e956ee4298476cdc7c14b0fb136bf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/51dac45c7bbc4ed4f43abf20e47bcef8e784477da88ef09e0e2983324a84cab8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c1ef8f1d472fc7da9ee661d8d541b3580b38cc81259124024c12f05f77e1da5b.jpg"],"titleId":"010064a00be0e000","dlc":[]}